Important Interview Point

CodeBuild = Build + Test

CodeBuild does not primarily perform production deployment.

Deployment is handled by services such as AWS CodeDeploy.

CodeBuild vs Jenkins

CodeBuild| Jenkins
AWS managed service| Usually self-managed
No build server management| Server/infrastructure may need management
Integrates naturally with AWS| Highly extensible
Pay for build usage| Infrastructure/plugin management required
